{
  "mcpServers": {
    "mcdonalds-china": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@mcdonalds-china/mcp-server"],
      "env": {
        "MCD_API_KEY": "${MCD_API_KEY}",
        "MCD_API_SECRET": "${MCD_API_SECRET}",
        "MCD_STORE_ID": "${MCD_STORE_ID}"
      }
    }
  },
  "_comment": "麦当劳 MCP Server 脱敏配置示例。所有敏感项均为环境变量占位符，使用前请在本地环境导出真实值，切勿将真实密钥提交至仓库。实际包名与参数以 M-China/mcd-mcp-server 官方仓库为准。"
}
